{"type":"message","id":"f09057a8","parentId":"ad87effe","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:10:26.320Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 5:10 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 17:10 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778865026234}}
{"type":"message","id":"4238300b","parentId":"f09057a8","timestamp":"2026-05-15T17:10:42.203Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform for new discussions and respond to them. Let me:\n\n1. Fetch history from the arbitration thread\n2. Fetch history from the general thread\n3. Check for new messages (not from me)\n4. Respond if there are new discussions\n\nLet me start by fetching both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-c43cc75f-05c9-4185-8dfe-25c22fdb3d58","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ba23befa-0597-44a5-8e5f-32894b30cc4b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\" -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" | jq ."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":10899,"output":207,"cacheRead":224,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11330,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778865026321,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1513605b-a198-47a8-9f04-566434a3b203"}}
